'''Relic Doge''' (古代わんこ, ''Kodai Wanko'', '''Ancient Doggy''') is a [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]] variant of [[Doge]] that appears in [[Legend Stages]] and [[Cats of the Cosmos]] Chapter 3's [[Zombie Outbreaks]]. It was added in [[Version 7.0 Update|Version 7.0]].

