==Trivia==
*Relic Doge and [[Sir Rel]] are the only [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic enemies]] to appear in the [[Main Chapters Levels|Main Chapters]], both in [[Cats of the Cosmos]] Chapter 3's [[Zombie Outbreaks]].
*Relic Doge and [[Idi:Re]] are the only Relic enemies to appear in [[Stories of Legend]], both in the [[Eldritch Forces/Invasion|Eldritch Forces Invasion]].
*Relic Doge and [[Haniwanwan]] are the only Relic enemies whose Curse abilities do not have a 100% chance to activate.
*Before Relic Doge's proper introduction in [[An Ancient Curse]], it can be seen as a cameo in the background of [[Eldritch Forces]] inside a container.

